/ The mark keeps half its width from each end, so it stays inside
span class='mt-1 flex w-full max-w-36 flex-col gap-1' aria-hidden='true'
  span class='relative block h-1 w-full rounded-full bg-fill-strong'
    span class='absolute -top-1 w-1 h-3 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-sm bg-fg ring-2 ring-surface' style="left: clamp(0.125rem, #{position}%, 100% - 0.125rem)"
  span class='flex justify-between text-xs leading-none tabular-nums text-muted'
    - ends.each do |number|
      span = number
